{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":11},"Les Municipaux, ces héros","Port Vendres est un port magnifique situé en Catalogne française... Magnifique et tellement français : un maire bling-bling et des employés municipaux toujours à fond ! À fond dans les acquis sociaux, à fond contre les cadences infernales, à fond dans la déconne... celle qui fait qu’on les aime... Et si de plus ils deviennent des héros alors il n’y a plus aucune raison de ne pas s’inscrire à ce voyage dans la vraie vie. (Faced with representatives of regional, state municipal and even European councils, the mayor of Port-Vendres, a pretty port city in Catalan country, tries to praise the merits of his village.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"low rank employment","marriage","parenthood","activism","rural","class conflict","class solidarity",{"type":12,"id":13,"slug":14,"title":15,"release":17,"filmType":21,"directors":22,"genre":36,"media":38,"synopsis":41,"production":44,"characters":47,"roles":63,"awards":103,"tags":3},"Film","FR2018_079","fr2018-079-les-municipaux-ces-heros",{"native":1,"english":16},"",{"type":18,"date":19,"year":20},"Theatrical release","2018-04-25",2018,"Fiction film",[23,31],{"id":24,"slug":25,"name":24,"birthYear":26,"deathYear":27,"gender":28,"nationality":29,"awards":30},"Éric Carrière","eric-carriere",1957,0,"Male identifying","France",[],{"id":32,"slug":33,"name":32,"birthYear":34,"deathYear":27,"gender":28,"nationality":29,"awards":35},"Francis Ginibre","francis-ginibre",1959,[],[37],"Comedy",{"posterUrl":39,"trailerUrl":40},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/69/216/186437/format_page/les-municipaux-ces-heros.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1h2bUdR4wJQ&t=13s",{"native":42,"english":43},"Port Vendres est un port magnifique situé en Catalogne française... Magnifique et tellement français : un maire bling-bling et des employés municipaux toujours à fond ! À fond dans les acquis sociaux, à fond contre les cadences infernale